# A cast iron street lamp with a glass lantern. The main source of warmth on
# the street at night: one every few tiles along the curb.
sprite street-lamp
size 16 48
layer object
footprint 1 1
origin 0 32
tag lamp light street
light 8 8 60 #ffd27a 1.2

frame default
